      html: [
        `<section class="docs-section" id="requirements"><h2>系统要求</h2><div class="docs-table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>项目</th><th>要求</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>系统</td><td>Windows 10 / 11 x64</td></tr><tr><td>磁盘</td><td>安装包约 220.4 MiB；安装后约 821.6 MiB，并为视频输出预留空间</td></tr><tr><td>显卡</td><td>Light 版可使用 DirectML/ONNX；NVIDIA 显卡可进一步启用 NVDEC / NVENC</td></tr><tr><td>联网</td><td>安装后分析不依赖在线服务；检查更新与访问 GitHub Release 时需要网络</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
        <section class="docs-section" id="download"><h2>1. 从可信来源下载</h2><p>只使用固定版本的公开 Release 资产：</p><div class="docs-command"><code>https://github.com/Lijinzh/TennisVideoHelper/releases/download/v0.1.4/TennisVideoHelper-Setup-0.1.4.exe</code></div><p>文件大小应为 <strong>231,136,955 字节</strong>，SHA-256 应为：</p><div class="docs-command"><code>AC02F957D9768C9849EFC85DF88D7CF3E331441A91AE0A8CE760FF9CCC16B40F</code></div><pre><code>Get-FileHash .\TennisVideoHelper-Setup-0.1.4.exe -Algorithm SHA256</code></pre></section>
        <section class="docs-callout docs-callout--warning" id="smartscreen"><strong>SmartScreen 提示</strong><p>当前安装包尚未数字签名，因此 Windows 可能显示“未知发布者”。核对文件名、大小和 SHA-256 后，可选择“更多信息”查看目标文件；不要运行来自网盘、聊天附件或未知镜像的副本。</p></section>
        <section class="docs-section" id="install"><h2>2. 安装或覆盖升级</h2><ol class="docs-steps"><li><span>01</span><div><strong>退出正在运行的软件</strong><p>避免安装器等待旧进程释放程序文件。</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>运行安装包</strong><p>按向导选择是否创建桌面快捷方式。默认安装在当前用户的本地程序目录。</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>直接覆盖旧版本</strong><p>升级会清理旧的 <code>_internal</code>，但保留 QSettings 用户设置和外部输出目录。</p></div></li></ol></section>
        <section class="docs-section" id="first-launch"><h2>3. 第一次启动</h2><p>软件打开后先进入主工作台。建议依次完成：</p><ul><li>在“文件”菜单选择一个视频或视频文件夹。</li><li>选择独立的输出目录，不要把输出指向源视频目录。</li><li>打开“参数调节”，确认界面语言、球场背景和默认参数。</li><li>首次试用可勾选“仅分析前 5 分钟”，缩短等待时间。</li><li>NVIDIA 用户可点击“检测并优化”，用真实视频选择可靠且更快的后端。</li></ul></section>
        <section class="docs-section" id="first-analysis"><h2>4. 分析第一个视频</h2><ol class="docs-steps"><li><span>A</span><div><strong>点击“开始分析”</strong><p>任务在后台线程运行，界面显示真实阶段、完成百分比、已用时间和预计剩余时间。</p></div></li><li><span>B</span><div><strong>等待候选进入复核列表</strong><p>候选片段已通过媒体探测，但还没有发布为最终结果。</p></div></li><li><span>C</span><div><strong>逐段播放和检查击球点</strong><p>用时间线跳转到确认击球；取消勾选误判片段。</p></div></li><li><span>D</span><div><strong>点击“导出勾选片段”</strong><p>只有这一步完成后，复核选择和最终报告才会原子发布。</p></div></li></ol></section>
        <section class="docs-section" id="find-results"><h2>5. 找到输出结果</h2><pre><code>精选输出/
└── 视频文件名/
    ├── clips/
    ├── segments.csv
    ├── analysis.json
    └── review-selection.json</code></pre><p><code>clips/</code> 是最终保留的视频；其余文件记录片段摘要、全部分析证据和人工复核结果。</p></section>
        <section class="docs-section" id="next"><h2>下一步</h2><div class="docs-link-list"><a href="using.html">学习完整桌面与 CLI 工作流 →</a><a href="guides.html#tuning">根据漏检或误检进行调参 →</a><a href="reference.html#outputs">查看输出文件字段与用途 →</a></div></section>`,
        `<section class="docs-section" id="requirements"><h2>Requirements</h2><div class="docs-table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Area</th><th>Requirement</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>OS</td><td>Windows 10 / 11 x64</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>About 220.4 MiB to download and 821.6 MiB installed, plus output space</td></tr><tr><td>GPU</td><td>The Light edition supports DirectML/ONNX; NVIDIA hardware can also use NVDEC / NVENC</td></tr><tr><td>Network</td><td>Analysis is offline; update checks and GitHub Releases need connectivity</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
        <section class="docs-section" id="download"><h2>1. Download from a trusted source</h2><p>Use the exact public Release asset:</p><div class="docs-command"><code>https://github.com/Lijinzh/TennisVideoHelper/releases/download/v0.1.4/TennisVideoHelper-Setup-0.1.4.exe</code></div><p>Expected size: <strong>231,136,955 bytes</strong>. Expected SHA-256:</p><div class="docs-command"><code>AC02F957D9768C9849EFC85DF88D7CF3E331441A91AE0A8CE760FF9CCC16B40F</code></div><pre><code>Get-FileHash .\TennisVideoHelper-Setup-0.1.4.exe -Algorithm SHA256</code></pre></section>
        <section class="docs-callout docs-callout--warning" id="smartscreen"><strong>SmartScreen</strong><p>The installer is currently unsigned, so Windows may show an unknown publisher. Verify the filename, size, and hash before choosing More info. Do not run copies received through unknown mirrors or chat attachments.</p></section>
        <section class="docs-section" id="install"><h2>2. Install or upgrade</h2><ol class="docs-steps"><li><span>01</span><div><strong>Close the running app</strong><p>This lets the installer replace packaged program files cleanly.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>Run the installer</strong><p>Choose whether to create a desktop shortcut. Installation is per-user by default.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>Upgrade in place</strong><p>The installer removes stale <code>_internal</code> files while preserving settings and external output folders.</p></div></li></ol></section>
        <section class="docs-section" id="first-launch"><h2>3. First launch</h2><ul><li>Select one video or a video folder from File.</li><li>Choose a separate output directory.</li><li>Open Settings to confirm language, court background, and defaults.</li><li>Use “analyze first 5 minutes” for a quick initial trial.</li><li>On NVIDIA systems, run Detect and Optimize with a real sample.</li></ul></section>
        <section class="docs-section" id="first-analysis"><h2>4. Run your first analysis</h2><ol class="docs-steps"><li><span>A</span><div><strong>Start Analysis</strong><p>The background task reports real stage, progress, elapsed time, and ETA.</p></div></li><li><span>B</span><div><strong>Wait for review candidates</strong><p>Validated candidates remain staged and are not final output yet.</p></div></li><li><span>C</span><div><strong>Review clips and hit points</strong><p>Use the timeline to inspect confirmed hits and deselect false positives.</p></div></li><li><span>D</span><div><strong>Export Selected Clips</strong><p>This publishes the final clips and review report atomically.</p></div></li></ol></section>
        <section class="docs-section" id="find-results"><h2>5. Find the results</h2><pre><code>SelectedOutput/
└── VideoName/
    ├── clips/
    ├── segments.csv
    ├── analysis.json
    └── review-selection.json</code></pre></section>
        <section class="docs-section" id="next"><h2>Next steps</h2><div class="docs-link-list"><a href="using.html">Learn the full desktop and CLI workflow →</a><a href="guides.html#tuning">Tune missed detections or false positives →</a><a href="reference.html#outputs">Read the output reference →</a></div></section>`
      ]
