        <section class="docs-section" id="architecture"><h2>Layered architecture</h2><div class="docs-layer-list"><article><b>core</b><p>Stable configuration and domain models without OpenCV, PyTorch, or PySide6.</p></article><article><b>media</b><p>Probe, decode, export, runtime, and safe publication without hit decisions.</p></article><article><b>detection</b><p>Audio, vision, racket, and fusion algorithms without UI or output publication.</p></article><article><b>review</b><p>Human review state, selection, and reports.</p></article><article><b>app</b><p>Pipeline, CLI, optimizer, and updater orchestration.</p></article><article><b>ui</b><p>PySide6 interface that calls application and review APIs.</p></article></div><p><a href="../architecture.md">Read the full architecture guide →</a></p></section>
